# Line endings: git normalises text, and leaves binaries alone.
* text=auto

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No Git LFS.
#
# With the addons folder kept out of this repo, nothing here comes close to
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit: the largest file is under 1 MB. LFS would
# add a dependency for no benefit, and it fails badly when it is missing -
# anyone cloning without git-lfs installed would get a small text pointer
# where a binary should be, which for a nodegraph would look like a working
# file and behave like a broken one.
#
# The binary types below are marked so line-ending normalisation never
# touches them. If a large binary is ever added here, add LFS back then.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ain  -text
*.nav  -text
*.bsp  -text
*.mdl  -text
*.vtx  -text
*.vvd  -text
*.phy  -text
*.ani  -text
*.vtf  -text
*.pcf  -text
*.wav  -text
*.mp3  -text
*.ogg  -text
*.png  -text
*.jpg  -text
*.ttf  -text
*.otf  -text
*.db   -text
